{"id":"u-3dffdcf7-c2c2-4d06-b220-6e9126f5c0d2","src":"community","title":"Natural Hypertrophy Girl programme","author":"Kidus Girma","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Pw0286-natural-hypertrophy-girl-programme","desc":"Unlike generic programs adapted from male templates, this routine prioritises:\n\nGlute and leg development\n\nUpper back shaping\n\nCore strength and posture\n\nBalanced lower body proportions\n\nJoint health and injury prevention\n\n\nThe program is built around compound movements and progressive overload, while reducing unnecessary upper-body hypertrophy emphasis.\n\nIt is ideal for women who:\n\nAre new to lifting\n\nWant to look more toned and shapely\n\nWant stronger glutes and legs\n\nPrefer structured resistance training over cardio-based routines\n\nWant something serious but not overwhelming\n\n\nThis is not a powerlifting or bodybuilding program.\nIt is a foundational hypertrophy template designed for aesthetics and long-term physical development.\n\n\n---\n\nStructure\n\nFrequency: 3 days per week\n\nSplit: Full body each session\n\nFocus: Lower body dominant\n\nRep Range: Moderate to high reps\n\nGoal: Muscle development and structural balance\n\n\nRecommended schedule:\n\nMonday\n\nWednesday\n\nFriday\n\n\nRest days between sessions allow recovery while maintaining training frequency.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-03T17:14:26.537Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full body 1","Full body 2","Full body 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":4}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Decline Sit Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":4}]},{"n":"Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":4}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,